==Battleground==
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is essentially [[Border Between Worlds]] reborn, except with newer threats like Condemned Peng and Mini White Cyclone making their appearance here.

While this stage might seem annoying given that each enemy requires a specific unit to counter them and thus restricts your lineup a lot, [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Newtone]] and [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Nova]] can serve as generalist attackers for everyone here easily. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] can serve as your main attackers for the baddie bonanza, while you bring specialized attackers like [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] to deal with the other pushing enemies. Make sure to bring [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to chain down any attacker you want, and this stage will be cleared without much trouble.

